Tapping a reminder now opens its own subject:

• Morning and evening adhkar, istighfar and Ayat al-Kursi open the adhkar screen
• Your daily portion and Surat al-Mulk open the mushaf
• Duha and the Friday sunnahs open the daily sunnah tracker
• Tomorrow's fast opens the calendar
• The night of Jumuah opens its own sheet

Every reminder used to open the home screen instead.

Please try these and send what you find. Feedback through Google Play itself is best.
